# RULE 24 — MODULE COMPLETION = N of M (2026-07-24) — PERMANENT

**Why this exists:** Jorge asked for a permanent, mechanical answer to “is Accounting / Banking done?” after ~250 money PRs left live economics empty. **PR count is not the metric.** Checklist items with Neon/spec proof are.

## Machine source of truth

| Module | Manifest | Scoreboard |
|---|---|---|
| Accounting | `docs/module-completion/accounting.json` | `docs/module-completion/accounting.md` |
| Banking | `docs/module-completion/banking.json` | `docs/module-completion/banking.md` |
| Schema | `docs/module-completion/SCHEMA.md` | — |

**PROGRESS: N of M** = count of items with `status: PASS` (or qualifying owner `HOLD` with `owner_hold` + `tracker` + `future_block`).

**`complete: true` is ILLEGAL** while any item is OPEN / FAIL / UNVERIFIED / non-qualifying HOLD.  
CI: verify-step **1431** (`verify-module-completion`).

## Forbidden

1. Claiming “accounting done”, “banking done”, or “module complete” while that module’s `complete !== true`.
2. Using PR volume (“250 PRs”, “47/47 waves”) as proof of module DONE.
3. Setting `complete: true` without every item PASS (or qualifying HOLD).
4. Leaving `*.md` scoreboards stale vs `*.json` (run `node scripts/verify-module-completion.mjs --write-md`).

## Required on every money commit (with Rule 23 / DoD §10)

```
MODULE_PROGRESS: accounting N of M
# and/or
MODULE_PROGRESS: banking N of M
ITEMS_TOUCHED: ACCT-… | BANK-…
```

`N of M` **must match** the current manifest score for that module (update the JSON in the same PR when an item moves to PASS).

## How a module becomes COMPLETE

1. Every checklist item → `PASS` with LIVE Neon (`bypass_rls=lucia`) + DoD A–E + VERIFY 1–8 evidence in the item, **or** owner-written HOLD with tracker + future block id.
2. Set `complete: true` in the JSON; regenerate `.md`.
3. Desktop module audit (`~/Desktop/IH35-CURSOR-AUDIT/modules/<module>.md`) agrees — no ranked FAIL open for that module’s money leaves.
4. Claude coder merge only after `JORGE-APPROVED` on financial.

## Session header (Rule 20 companion)

When working a money module, open with:

```
BLOCK: …
MODULE: accounting|banking
PROGRESS: N of M pending-items-closed · see docs/module-completion/<module>.md
STATUS: …
```

## Tie-breakers

PR volume < checklist N of M · CI-green < Neon density · memory < manifest + verify-step 1431.
